From cf3dc7940e694b376f0b602b5d491c853e09927e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Olivier Louvignes <olivier@mgcrea.io>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:29:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] mfd: axp20x: import AXP2101 regulator and power supply
 support

Port Olivier Louvignes's seven-patch October 23 AXP2101 submission to the
Q2 Linux 7.3 development tree, including its DT binding additions.
Original Message-ID: 20261023100401.67592-1-olivier@mgcrea.io
Source: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261023100401.67592-1-olivier@mgcrea.io/

The series derives from Jepl4r/hiby-custom-kernel and was tested by its
author on a HiBy R1. Those results are not Q2 hardware validation.
Q2-specific no-IRQ support, stock-binary cross-checks and corrections
follow separately. Preserve the original author; no new certification
or upstream submission is implied by this development series.
